  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "sentence": "A 10-year-old blue Toyota Prius was rocketing through northern Vermont on the afternoon of Jan. 20 when a U.S.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 19,
      "start_time": 0.0,
      "end_time": 8.475,
      "duration": 8.475,
      "phoneme_count": 119
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "sentence": "Border Patrol agent pulled it over for an immigration inspection.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 10,
      "start_time": 8.475,
      "end_time": 13.225,
      "duration": 4.75,
      "phoneme_count": 68
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "sentence": "Law enforcement officers had been watching the two people inside the car for the better part of a week, since a hotel employee reported that they were armed and dressed in tactical gear.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 33,
      "start_time": 13.225,
      "end_time": 25.575,
      "duration": 12.35,
      "phoneme_count": 181
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "sentence": "Shortly before the Prius was stopped, officers watched them buy aluminum foil at a Walmart and wrap it around their phones.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 21,
      "start_time": 25.575,
      "end_time": 33.975,
      "duration": 8.4,
      "phoneme_count": 120
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "sentence": "Now, on a stretch of highway flanked by snow-crusted ground and hardwood forest, one of the agents asked them to get out of the car.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 25,
      "start_time": 33.975,
      "end_time": 42.95,
      "duration": 8.975,
      "phoneme_count": 134
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "sentence": "There seemed little explanation for what happened next.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 8,
      "start_time": 42.95,
      "end_time": 46.625,
      "duration": 3.675,
      "phoneme_count": 56
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "sentence": "The driver of the Prius was a U.S. citizen with no criminal record.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 13,
      "start_time": 46.625,
      "end_time": 51.875,
      "duration": 5.25,
      "phoneme_count": 72
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "sentence": "The passenger, a German national, had an H-1B visa, reserved for highly skilled workers.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 14,
      "start_time": 51.875,
      "end_time": 59.1,
      "duration": 7.225,
      "phoneme_count": 96
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "sentence": "Items found in the car might have suggested a dark purpose, but were not illicit: a ballistic helmet, a night-vision monocular, full-face respirators and hollow-point ammunition.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 26,
      "start_time": 59.1,
      "end_time": 71.975,
      "duration": 12.875,
      "phoneme_count": 182
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "sentence": "Yet without warning, according to an F.B.I. affidavit, the driver drew a Glock pistol and opened fire.",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 17,
      "start_time": 71.975,
      "end_time": 79.825,
      "duration": 7.85,
      "phoneme_count": 106
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "sentence": "A Border Patrol agent fired back.",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 6,
      "start_time": 79.825,
      "end_time": 82.85,
      "duration": 3.025,
      "phoneme_count": 37
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "sentence": "The passenger also reached for a gun, according to an incident summary by the Border Patrol.",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 16,
      "start_time": 82.85,
      "end_time": 89.65,
      "duration": 6.8,
      "phoneme_count": 92
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "sentence": "The agent ordered the passenger to stop.",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 7,
      "start_time": 89.65,
      "end_time": 92.825,
      "duration": 3.175,
      "phoneme_count": 40
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "sentence": "The demand was ignored, and the agent shot at the passenger, too, the summary said.",
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "word_count": 15,
      "start_time": 92.825,
      "end_time": 98.775,
      "duration": 5.95,
      "phoneme_count": 81
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "sentence": "The driver went down, struck in the arm and the leg.",
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "word_count": 11,
      "start_time": 98.775,
      "end_time": 102.625,
      "duration": 3.85,
      "phoneme_count": 53
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "sentence": "The passenger, hit twice in the chest, died at the scene.",
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "word_count": 11,
      "start_time": 102.625,
      "end_time": 106.725,
      "duration": 4.1,
      "phoneme_count": 54
    },
    {
